From 2218107dac0150151b39d736924df57e8dc75104 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Sotraidis <56282582+chrissotraidis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 05:34:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Complete PE draw-sync tokens and Pictobox RAM copies

Model PE token and finish masks, pending events and independent acknowledgments. At a drained draw-sync boundary, submit the capture copy and read I8/RGB565 tiles back to guest RAM before exposing completion. Preserve GPU-only copies and bound asynchronous readback failure.

Validate token MMIO/acks, tiled formats and render scaling with focused tests and ASan/UBSan. Mac Metal regular and Deluxe captures show actual photo content, accept an album photo, repeat, cancel and return to gameplay on copied Windfall fixtures. Persistent game save/reload and native Windows remain open.

Co-authored-by: Elliott Tate <elliotttate@gmail.com>
